<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/College> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An academic organization that is either a small degree-giving university, or (in the OxBridge sense) an independent corporation of scholars within a larger university, providing undergraduate tuition and a social environment for its students and fellows."@en .
